 about the multiplicities of the roots:\n\n- Since the graph is *not* tangent to the $x$-axis at $x=-4,$ this root is a simple root (the multiplicity equals $1$).\n\n- Since the graph is *not* tangent to the $x$-axis at $x=-3,$ this root is a simple root (the multiplicity equals $1$).\n\n- Since the graph is *not* tangent to the $x$-axis at $x=-2,$ this root is a simple root (the multiplicity equals $1$).\n\nFrom the given options, the only possible equation is $y =-(x+3)(x+4)(x+2).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["a6479165-59ff-5980-bc64-72ce958f7d26"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "ad8a3212-9053-5b71-be5a-10d350d1d6f2" :answer/id #uuid "ad8a3212-9053-5b71-be5a-10d350d1d6f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{1}{4}(x+6)(x+4)^{2}(x+1)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5f888d97-abb2-5732-a2d7-0efbffbbcdef" :answer/id #uuid "5f888d97-abb2-5732-a2d7-0efbffbbcdef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{1}{4}(x+5)(x+4)^{3}(x+1)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8e716e72-2836-5bac-8c5f-c7380cd715fd" :answer/id #uuid "8e716e72-2836-5bac-8c5f-c7380cd715fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{1}{4}(x+5)(x+4)^{2}(x+1)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "1b212d63-7c32-58cf-bc60-ed6e6947b31c" :answer/id #uuid "1b212d63-7c32-58cf-bc60-ed6e6947b31c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{1}{4}(x+5)(x+4)(x+1)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e4d4eb42-b289-5926-903a-18a750c85907" :answer/id #uuid "e4d4eb42-b289-5926-903a-18a750c85907" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=- \\frac{1}{4}(x+5)(x+4)^{2}(x+1)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0b814f3f-fda0-5f95-8878-64c99e13a79a" :answer-field/id #uuid "0b814f3f-fda0-5f95-8878-64c99e13a79a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["ad8a3212-9053-5b71-be5a-10d350d1d6f2" "5f888d97-abb2-5732-a2d7-0efbffbbcdef" "8e716e72-2836-5bac-